# Barbed Sextant is a mana ability and can be activated during a spell's mana payment (CR 605.3a).
# Island pays the Sextant's cost and the white mana it makes pays for Giver of Runes.
# These sources cannot pay two mana for Grizzly Bears: the Sextant costs one of the mana it makes.
